            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. In the event an individual has multiple appointments, she/he shall be eligible to participate in the benefits provided in Article 4 - Benefits if a majority of his/her appointment(s) time occurs in positions included in the unit.",
